Troubleshooting Tips
Common Issues and Solutions
Issue: Terraform init fails

# Clear cache and retry
rm -rf .terraform .terraform.lock.hcl
terraform init
Issue: Docker permission denied

# Ensure user in docker group
sudo usermod -aG docker $USER
newgrp docker
Issue: Port already in use

# Check port usage
sudo netstat -tulpn | grep :8080

# Change port in variables or kill conflicting process
Issue: State lock error

# Remove lock file (only if no other terraform process running)
rm -f .terraform.tfstate.lock.info
Issue: Resource already exists

# Import existing resource
terraform import docker_container.web_server <container_id>

# Or remove conflicting resource
docker rm -f <container_name>
